OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 21 JAN
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Dvorak
OL,5,     GKate Molleson explores the life
OL,6,     Gand loves of Antonin Dvorak.
OL,7,     GToday, how his Catholic religion
OL,8,     Gshaped his music and soul.
OL,9,G1700FIn Tune
OL,10,     GPetroc Trelawny has live music
OL,11,     Gfrom Le Vent du Nord - the folk
OL,12,     Gband from Quebec - and the Gould
OL,13,     GPiano Trio with clarinettist
OL,14,     GRobert Plane.
OL,15,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,16,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,17,     Gsoundscape of classical music,
OL,18,     Gincluding works by JS Bach,
OL,19,     GRavel, Rita Strohl and Cole
OL,20,     GPorter.
